		(property "Note" "Replaces BQ27427YZFR: BQ27427/BQ27426 have zero LiFePO4 chemistry-profile support (confirmed against datasheet -- only 4.2/4.35/4.4V Li-ion profiles exist). BQ34Z100 explicitly supports Li-ion and LiFePO4. Architecture changed from BQ27427's high-side integrated 7mOhm shunt to a low-side external sense resistor (R60 on the main sheet, in series between the true battery- terminal and system GND) -- SRP/SRN Kelvin-sense across R60."
			(at 255.27 261.62 0)
			(show_name no)
